# Docs metadata: README tables, SECURITY table and the "At a glance" box are generated from
# this (dev/gen-docs.py). One "key: value" per line.
emoji: 🔓
name: Grab guard
group: core
what: Tells you when desktop mode has taken all input (windows stop responding) and how to undo it.
why: A Right Ctrl press makes desktop mode grab every key and click; nothing on screen says so except its window title.
changes: `grab-guard`, user service `grab-guard`, a log in `~/.local/state/frame-tweaks/logs`
access: **Reads every keyboard's key presses**, and the Steam session's display's (only to notice Right Ctrl; nothing else is kept)
survives-updates: Yes (everything is in your home folder)
undo: `./install.sh uninstall grab-guard`
